Notes on third-party material

This shader pack contains no copied third-party shader code. All GLSL in
shaders/ was written for this project.

The following well known, publicly documented models and conventions are used
and implemented independently:

  * ACES filmic tone mapping fitted curve (Krzysztof Narkowicz / Stephen Hill
    public fits of the ACES reference transform).
  * Uchimura (Gran Turismo) tone mapping curve, as published by Hajime Uchimura.
  * labPBR resource pack convention for normal (_n) and specular (_s) maps.
  * Beer-Lambert absorption, Rayleigh/Mie single scattering, Cook-Torrance GGX
    BRDF with Smith visibility and Schlick Fresnel, Gerstner style wave sums,
    percentage closer soft shadows (PCSS) - standard graphics literature.
  * Iris / OptiFine shader pack format, documented in the public Iris ShaderDoc.

The tools/ directory is development tooling and is not part of the distributed
shader pack archive.
